+the requested exhaustive range.  The actual word endpoint is `h^{-1}g`;
+`g h^{-1}` can counterfeit the summed coefficient because `J_N` commutes
+with `H`, so the pending coordinator audit will include the recorded `S_3`
+word witness rather than only coefficient comparison.
+
+Checkpoint 3 (`2026-09-01T19:44Z`): R0 sharpened its bound using the exact
+one-particle gap of `K_N` minus one edge.  R3 found a candidate polynomial
+exact sampler, bypassing the partition-scale pointed-cycle DP by summing over
+the unique subset of used fixed labels and applying a positive transitive
+star-factor coefficient formula.  Neither is coordinator-accepted until the
+fresh audits finish.
