+Audit 1 (`2026-09-01T19:49Z`): coordinator accepts R0 and R1 as proved.
+For R0, the primary Theorem 1.1 states equality of the continuous-time
+interchange and one-particle gaps on every weighted graph; equation (2.3) in
+the role report gives the correct factor `M-1`.  For R1, the reduced fresh
+run reproduced the noncommuting `S_3` endpoint witness and the `N=2`
+zeroth-power boundary.  R3 remains conditional pending its mandated fresh
+nonauthor audit.
