+finite identities and found a new exact obstruction to one named architecture:
+uniform global conjugation and arbitrary Hurwitz postprocessing cannot change
+the weighted support-component signature of the adjacent-one-pair lift.
+The exact small-case TV gaps are persistent, but no dense asymptotic lower
+bound has been proved; the result therefore rejects exact equality for that
+architecture without rejecting the rank disintegration or R3 sampler.
+
+Checkpoint 5 (`2026-09-01T19:59Z`): R2 eliminates the extreme-`k` gap by
+flattening whichever endpoint walk has length at least `L/2`.  The proposal
+is positive and labeled, and its top-level error is superexponentially small
+on the requested scale.  This is not yet recursive closure: repeated
+old-long branches create random lower-rank lengths, so R4/R5 must prove a
+summable state-dependent telescope or give an exact fallback.
